    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-90.t01",
      "en": "I think there was a misunderstanding about what I said.",
      "es": "Creo que hubo un malentendido sobre lo que dije.",
      "explanationEs": "misunderstanding nombra el problema sin culpar a nadie.",
